    "Ciss is 1295 pF typical and 1650 pF maximum at VGS = 0 V, VDS = 10 V, f = 1 MHz; the strict schema stores the typical value and this note preserves the maximum.",
    "VSD is 0.62 V typical and 1.0 V maximum at IS = 1 A, VGS = 0 V; the strict schema stores the typical value and this note preserves the maximum.",
    "IDSS is 1 uA maximum at VDS = 20 V, VGS = 0 V, TJ = 25 degC and 5 uA maximum at TJ = 55 degC; the strict schema has no IDSS field.",
    "Qg = 10 nC typical, Qgs = 4.2 nC typical, and Qgd = 2.6 nC typical at VGS = 4.5 V, VDS = 10 V, ID = 6.5 A; the strict schema has no gate-charge field.",
    "Rg = 1.8 kohm typical at VGS = 0 V, VDS = 0 V, f = 1 MHz; the strict schema has no gate-resistance field.",
    "Curve points are manual reads from the real plotted traces in Figures 1, 2, and 8. Figure 2 contains separate 25 degC and 125 degC transfer curves; Figure 1 temperature is not stated.",
    "Thermal data are RthetaJA = 70 degC/W typ and 90 degC/W max for t <= 10 s, RthetaJA = 100 degC/W typ and 125 degC/W max steady-state, and RthetaJL = 63 degC/W typ and 80 degC/W max; the strict schema has no thermal fields."
